hat actual backendName, compiled artifact SHA and executed primitive unchanged. California SL.TrainingExecution obtains mlpdExecutionWitness after actual regression/evaluation; MlpDevice records engineBackend and executedArtifactIdentity, preserving onednn/metal/cuda.\",\n    \"new_helper_effect\": \"layerTrainingBackendIdentity names expected identities and replaces only an equal Apple fixed-bridge literal at dispatch; no kernel, gradient, graph, tensor, optimizer, data split or evaluation calculation changes.\",\n    \"tests_reviewed\": \"New pure refinements exercise class/regression for all three declared substrates; correct execution family passes while generic classification tags, full layer tags for regression, wrong lanes and unknown/blank tags fail. Six real backend checks assert actual post-operation witnesses against independent literals and the shared helper/profile. Test text review is not test execution. CUDA text inspection is not CUDA-lane approval.\",\n    \"known_old_data\": \"The refused C33 row000 cannot be relabelled current or qualified. Its original five outcomes and row001 partial attempt remain retained. This new predicate/source generation requires fresh current source binding and genuine new evidence.\"\n  },\n  \"historical_ad8d_primary\": {\n    \"file\": {\n      \"path\": \".build/phase278-mac-validation/resume-runtime-recovery-20261019T023812.865403Z/independent-ad8d-four-scope-criterion-review-20261019T203329.690507Z/apple-silicon-native-review.json\",\n      \"bytes\": 652453,\n      \"sha256\": \"520161939c27f8e55414acb215cae8ea3910cf41854e8201c5ab0546bf7ee917\"\n    },\n    \"role\": \"Literal immutable prior semantic review and nested C33 provenance; not current source authority\",\n    \"literal_UTF8\": \"{\\n  \\\"domain\\\": \\\"jitml-independent-ad8d-four-scope-criterion-applicability-v1\\\",\\n  \\\"reviewer\\\": \\\"/root/ad8d_criterion_independent_review\\\",\\n  \\\"reviewed_at_utc\\\": \\\"2026-10-19T20:33:29.690507+00:0